<title>USA: Energy Biosystems names Lopez chairman.</title>
<headline>Energy Biosystems names Lopez chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy BioSystems Corp said Wednesday that board member Ramon Lopez was unanimously elected chairman, succeeding John Webb.</p>
<p>Lopez joined Energy BioSystems' board of directors in March 1994, bringing the experience of his 38-year career at Royal Dutch/Shell Group's Shell Oil Co.</p>
<p>Throughout his tenure at Shell, Lopez held senior positions in all areas of petroleum refining and marketing, Energy Biosystems said.</p>
